        "E_LUC_CUSTOM_DECLARATION"
      ],
      "deadline_ms": null,
      "idempotency": "none",
      "status": "defined",
      "evidence": [
        "lumeri_runtime/luc_custom.py:405-447",
        "lumeri_runtime/luc_custom.py:469-491",
        "lumeri_runtime/luc_custom.py:555-674",
        "lumeri_runtime/luc_custom.py:450-466"
      ],
      "notes": "No timeout is enforced on synchronous lifecycle/renderer calls. create requires exactly operation/request_id/document and is deduplicated by capability, proven binding and request_id; different bytes conflict. load takes exactly operation/page_id. mount and unmount also require expected_revision; interact adds event. Later operations check scope, busy/state and revision. Retried unmount is natural only with the current revision. Interaction is not generally idempotent. Records and create replay mapping are in-memory and invalidated by restart. The data schema gives per-control field sets; number values must also lie between their bounds, select values must name an option, button actions must exist, identifiers must be unique and titles/labels must be trimmed nonempty strings."
    }
  ],
